                <a href="/projects/pascal-s/" title="Find out more about Pascal-S" class="summary-inline">This is the original Pascal-S project from Niklaus Wirth at ETH Zurich. It compiles and interprets in one step a subset of the Pascal language, and does it in only about 2000 lines.

You can find all of the Pascal-P versions here in sourceforge:

https://sourceforge.net/projects/pascal-s/
https://sourceforge.net/projects/pascal-p2/
https://sourceforge.net/projects/pascalp4/
